2	cond	If the player is not wearing a Ring of Charos:
3	line	50% Luke	That be a tale so heart-wrenchin' that it has so far wrenched the hearts from over a dozen sturdier men than thee!
3	line	50% Luke	A tale of such woe that none but the stoniest hearts can hear it without sheddin' a single, poignant tear...
3	line	50% Luke	And I'll never tell ye, not even if ye wore an item, such as a ring, with powers of mind control!
3	line	Player	What if I said please?
3	line	50% Luke	Hmmmm...well alright...
3	line	50% Luke	Wait, no!
3	line	50% Luke	Get goin' landlubber before I take my splintery foot to yer behind!
