2	cond	If the player is wearing a Ring of Charos:
3	line	50% Luke	Well ye seem like a [lad/lass] that can handle such a tale...so I'll tell ye...
3	line	50% Luke	Well, it all starts with this albatross...
3	line	50% Luke	Wait, never mind, I'll skip forward a bit.
3	line	Player	Are you sure?
3	line	50% Luke	I have to [lad/lass], Cap'n Donnie will flay what little is left of me if I told ye.
3	line	50% Luke	But anyway, I got recruited to the zombie pirates along with the rest of the crew in an unspecified incident involvin this albatross.
3	line	50% Luke	We was sailin' along happily, and I was partakin' of a little 'rum' in the crows nest.
3	line	50% Luke	Well, we hit either a really rough wave or some rocks.
3	line	50% Luke	Twas kind of hard for me to tell which, as I was well out of it by then!
3	line	50% Luke	Regardless I toppled from the crows nest into the water.
3	line	Player	Is that how you got so badly injured?
3	line	50% Luke	No [lad/lass]!
3	line	50% Luke	What happened next was that I discovered a new, previously uncharted reef of hard, spiky coral.
3	line	50% Luke	I made a mental note of its location, and to this day it is still marked on our fleet's charts as Lukes Reef.
3	line	50% Luke	I managed to grab a hold of our ship, the Inebriated, as it passed overhead.
3	line	50% Luke	And then I discovered another, taller, spikier reef of even sharper and more painful coral.
3	line	50% Luke	To this day it is still marked on our fleet's charts as The Other 50% Reef.
3	line	Player	Owwwwwwwww...
3	line	50% Luke	It gets worse...
3	line	50% Luke	When they hauled what was left of me on deck, they dropped me onto the floor while they decided what to do with me.
3	line	50% Luke	Bear in mind this would be on a ghost ship, the planks of which sweat a thick mixture of stagnant water...and pure salt crystals.
3	line	Player	Oh...my...god...
3	line	50% Luke	But on the good side, all my thrashin' and pained squealin' settled the matter in the Captain's mind, and he had the shipwright carve me half a body out of his Witchwood Planks.
3	line	Player	Witchwood? What's that?
3	line	50% Luke	Tis a special, magical wood from a now extinct tree.
3	line	50% Luke	Once they nailed it all in place the stuff moves like it is part of me body.
3	line	50% Luke	The stuff will also grow back if it breaks, which is dead handy!
3	line	Player	Wow, that stuff must be very valuable!
3	line	50% Luke	Arr! That it be!
3	line	50% Luke	So, that be the tale of how I managed to lose precisely 50% of my body.
3	line	Player	There there.
3	action	end
